sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  box rgba(21,101,192,0.04) Internal zone
    participant A as Replica A (branch credit-bureau)
    participant B as Replica B (branch fraud-check)
    participant DB as PostgreSQL (pre_instance, pre_token)
  end

  par both branches finish in the same millisecond
    A->>DB: SELECT ... FROM pre_instance WHERE tenant_id=? AND id=? FOR UPDATE
    B->>DB: SELECT ... FROM pre_instance WHERE tenant_id=? AND id=? FOR UPDATE (waits)
  end
  rect rgba(224,242,241,0.8)
    Note over A,DB: TX A holds the instance row lock
    A->>DB: token A JOINED at join-checks
    A->>DB: count tokens in the scope not yet JOINED: 1
    A->>DB: COMMIT (lock released, A does not advance)
  end
  rect rgba(224,242,241,0.8)
    Note over B,DB: TX B gets the lock after A commits
    B->>DB: lock acquired, token B JOINED
    B->>DB: count tokens in the scope not yet JOINED: 0
    B->>DB: INSERT one ACTIVE token at underwrite, A and B COMPLETED, COMMIT
  end
  Note over A,DB: Without the row lock both could count 1 (lost wakeup) or both count 0 (two tokens)
